Aerie-Purpose: Register chrome://filters, the page where users manage filter lists and per-site exceptions, and pack its resources.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/chrome_web_ui_configs.cc, chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn, chrome/chrome_paks.gni, tools/gritsettings/resource_ids.spec
Aerie-Kind: hook

The page is in chrome/browser/ui/webui/aerie_filters (the overlay). Its grd gets
the id range 10270 (10 ids), right after the one of patch 0002. The pak sits
next to the engine pak in chrome_extra_paks.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/chrome_web_ui_configs.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/chrome_web_ui_configs.cc
@@ -17,2 +17,3 @@
